    "description": {
      "en": "$tsceeui_rate1 is the general employee unemployment-insurance contribution rate, applied on income groups A/B. It is used in the Comp_perTU formula of the 'Unemployment insurance contribution' component in tscee_fr/BenCalc. The FR country report (Table 2.57) and the FR contributions description both list this rate at 0%, matching the constant's value across the observed period."
